Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,could the eagles beat
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.90,0:00:02.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,11 inflatable tube men?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:03.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,the eagles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:04.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,have saquon barkley.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,the tube men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,are full of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,this should be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:07.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,the easiest win
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:08.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:09.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,except, the eagles
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.82,0:00:10.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,have lost six straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.96,0:00:12.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,games, their first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,six-game skid since 2012.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.32,0:00:14.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,kickoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.96,0:00:15.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,the eagles go
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,up 10 to nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:17.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,then they
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:18.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,never score again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:19.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,saquon runs straight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,into a tube man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.02,0:00:22.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,it flops over and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.04,0:00:23.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,pops right back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:24.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,two yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:26.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,tanner mckee drops back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.02,0:00:27.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,five tube men flail
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.06,0:00:28.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,at him at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:28.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,sacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.64,0:00:30.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,five times.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:31.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,jake elliott lines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.16,0:00:32.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,up a field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.24,0:00:32.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:33.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,off the upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:34.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,then the tube men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,score 27 straight points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,final score: tube
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:40.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,men 27, eagles 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:41.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,one tube man
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:42.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,kicked four field
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.10,0:00:43.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,goals and outscored
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:44.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,the eagles by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.78,0:00:45.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,next week, the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,eagles host the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:47.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,the tube men
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:48.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,are still waving.
